      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dryden%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s southern edge follows the Powell River, while the Jefferson National Forest borders it to the north.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
